---
<section class="cta container" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <div>
    <h2 id="cta-heading">Your board looks like this on day three.</h2>
    <p>Pilots get their own board on the first day of intake — same lanes, same log, same gates, scoped to your store.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn ghost mono" href="/pricing">See pricing</a>
    <a class="btn solid mono" href="/contact">Open a pilot</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
    padding-block: 46px;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 56px; align-items: end;
  }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(32px, 4.2vw, 46px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.045em; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 18ch; }
  p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--dark-mute); max-width: 44ch; }
  .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-self: end; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn { padding: 15px 24px; font-size: 11px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .ghost { border: 1px solid var(--paper); color: var(--paper); }
  .ghost:hover { background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }
  .solid { background: var(--mag); color: var(--card); }
  .solid:hover { background: var(--orange); color: var(--card); }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .cta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .actions { justify-self: start; }
  }
</style>
